{"id":"663593","name":"土豆青菜筒骨汤","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/663593/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"筒骨","amount":"644克"},{"name":"青菜","amount":"266克"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"297克"}],"sub":[{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：筒骨（已清洗焯水）、青菜、土豆。","img":"images/663593/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将青菜掰开洗净捞出。","img":"images/663593/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将土豆洗净去皮。","img":"images/663593/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放在案板上切开。","img":"images/663593/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将筒骨下入高压锅里，加适量的料酒。","img":"images/663593/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加适量的开水。","img":"images/663593/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盖上盖，上气烧煮15分钟后关火。","img":"images/663593/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"焖至没气后开盖。","img":"images/663593/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"接着，合入切好的土豆。","img":"images/663593/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盖上盖，上气烧煮2分钟后关火。","img":"images/663593/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"焖至没气后再次开盖。","img":"images/663593/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"然后，合入已洗净的青菜翻动一下煮上2分钟。","img":"images/663593/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"最后，加适量的盐。","img":"images/663593/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加适量的味精。","img":"images/663593/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"调味翻匀即成。","img":"images/663593/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}